{"id":"NCT05726825","title":"Efficacy of Add-on Plasma Exchange As an Adjunctive Strategy Against Septic Shock","official":"Randomized, Prospective, Multicenter, Open-label, Controlled, Parallel-group Trial Investigating the Efficacy of Add-on Plasma Exchange As an Adjunctive Strategy Against Septic Shock - 2","summary":"Randomized, prospective, multicenter, open-label, controlled, parallel-group interventional trial to test the adjunctive effect of therapeutic plasma exchange in patients with early septic shock.","conditions":["Septic Shock"],"interventions":[{"type":"DEVICE","name":"Therapeutic Plasma Exchange (TPE)"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* New onset of septic shock (\\< 24 hrs), (SEPSIS-3 definition)\n* Norepinephrine (NE) dose ≥ 0.4 μg/kg/min ≥ 30 min OR NE ≥ 0.3 μg/kg/min + vasopressin (any dose)\n* Established vascular access suitable for plasma exchange independent of study inclusion (due to established indication of RRT, expected need for RRT within the next 48 hours or other medical reasons as assessed by treating physician team)\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Age \\< 18 or \\> 80 years\n* Urogenital focus of infection\n* Pregnancy\n* Heparin-induced thrombocytopenia\n* Known reaction against fresh frozen plasma (FFP)","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"80 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"TREATMENT","enrollment":274,"start":"2025-02-19","pcd":"2028-02","upd":"2025-03-13","sponsor":"Hannover Medical School","areas":["other"],"central":["Sascha David, Prof. Dr. · +41 44 255 8653 · sascha.david@usz.ch","Klaus Stahl, PD Dr. · +49 (0)176 1532 8277 · stahl.klaus@mh-hannover.de"],"sites":[{"f":"St. Joseph Hospital","city":"Berlin","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105,"c":"Christoph Buettner · Christoph.Buettner@sjk.de"},{"f":"University Hospital Berlin Charite","city":"Berlin","pr":"","zip":"","s":"NYR","lat":52.5244,"lon":13.4105,"c":"Philipp Enghard, PD Dr. · philipp.enghard@charite.de"},{"f":"Un